  "description": "48v14ah 672wh Panasonic Cells\nBafang 30 Amp M620 Ultra Motor Mid Drive with Torque and Throttle Shimano Deore Shifting (9s), Rockshox Recon 150 and Monarch RT Suspension, 27.5x3\" Trail Rated Alex Rims Wheels and More\nRange 20-45m Assisted Speed to 28mph\nTracker Ultra Model Walkthrough video\nHigh-strength 27.5x3\" Wheel Set To Ride With Confidence\nThe Tracker features a proper spec'd wheelset to command the climbs and hold steady through turns. Downhill capable wheels with Quando 12mm and 15mm thru-axle sealed hubs, laced to a M35 Alex Rims, fitted with Maxxis Chronicle tires.\nRockshox Recon 150mm Suspension Fork and Powerful Brakes\nThe Tracker delivers stronger steering and suspension to ride all of the roads and trails. Fully adjustable Recon 150mm of air suspension delivers smooth dampening and handling in all conditions. Tektro e500 (180mm) Hydraulic Brakes deliver powerful performance to complete a high quality ride.\nUltra Power Torque Pedal Assist and Responsive Throttle\nWith 160Nm of torque delivered through a torque pedal assist and throttle operation, know you're riding the industry's leading motor system to climb any trail.\nBattery Integrated Frame\nEnjoy a quality ride that is built to last - no plastic housing, or bulky frame and rack mountings are used on the Tracker. Tracker features a keyed lock, with additional latch to endure you have the top rated power to keep rolling.\nQuality Electronic Power Guaranteed\nOur packs feature all aluminum housing, that securely locks and can be charged installed or away from the frame. With over ten years of on the trail performance, Volton's lightweight, high capacity battery packs, and chargers ensure a long lasting and reliable source of power.",
